WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.240
That's a good ball again.

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:16.240
And it's a quite brilliant stop from Alisson.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.280
On by Isak.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.080
Barcola, saved by the goalkeeper.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.040
Touch by Wirtz.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:31.520
And in by Cody Gakpo,
and it's another good block.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:36.800
Szoboszlai!

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:49.360
Liverpool have been caught a man short.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:52.840
Fine piece of defensive work
by Jeremy Jacquet.

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:57.080
And now here come Bournemouth at pace.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:02.920
Rayan with the cross,
and Liverpool survive a tricky moment.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.480
Really good run by Cody Gakpo.

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:13.200
And a little touch, chance...

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:14.280
goal!

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:16.080
That's all it takes.

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:20.720
Alexander Isak arrives right on cue.

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:24.880
And Liverpool are in front, just like that.

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:28.920
- It's Isak that will get all the plaudits
and the glory of scoring the goal,

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:35.280
but it was Cody Gakpo down that
right side that really made the chance.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:39.800
Persistence personified by the big Dutchman.

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:45.360
- Gakpo, Isak...

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:47.840
Great challenge.

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:53.040
It's never been too easy on the eye...

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:56.480
but my, is it a big three points
if Liverpool can hold on.

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:58.400
And Lewis Koumas could have sealed it!

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:05.680
It doesn't matter how you win,
it just matters that you do,

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:08.760
and Andoni Iraola goes away
with all three points.

